The derived files are Go translations of SGLang's Python engine logic at the release named in
each file's header (SGLang v0.5.23, commit 297e54fd105e974cdf401e5b4d20253a22c16f90, unless the
file says otherwise). Each such file starts with:

    // SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    // SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright 2023-2024 SGLang Team
    // Derived from python/sglang/<path> at SGLang <tag> (<commit>).

so the upstream file and commit of every ported function can be found and diffed when SGLang
moves. A file with no such header is original to this repository.
